Comments:       To use: rsgain easy -S /path/to/music/library
                The -S (--skip-existing) option prevents you from rescanning your
                entire music library and adds only files with missing gain tags.
                To get more information run rsgain -h easy or rsgain -h custom 
                for more advanced options. 
                Presets are in: /usr/local/share/rsgain/presets
                Copy default.ini to create your own custom preset if you want to 
                go beyond easy mode and keep things consistent.
                To get a full understanging it's recommended to read the Usage
                section here: https://github.com/complexlogic/rsgain
